---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="ProtegeDatosLocal — Privacidad y Ley N° 21.719 para Municipios"
  description="Diagnostica brechas, genera decretos oficiales y prepara tu municipio antes del 1 de diciembre de 2026 sin fricción."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="pt-16 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
    <!-- Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900 mb-6">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-400 animate-pulse"></span>
      Ley N° 21.719 · Vigencia 1 de Diciembre de 2026
    </div>

    <!-- Main Title -->
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 dark:text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-5">
      Protección de datos para tu Municipio, <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">sin fricción.</span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Short Crisp Subtitle -->
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 font-normal leading-relaxed">
      Evalúa brechas institucionales, genera decretos tipo y aplica el filtro de privacidad en tus trámites comunales en minutos.
    </p>

    <!-- CTAs -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 mb-14">
      <a
        href="/diagnostico"
        class="px-6 py-3.5 bg-slate-950 dark:bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-600 dark:hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-xs transition text-xs sm:text-sm"
      >
        Iniciar Diagnóstico Municipal →
      </a>
      <a
        href="/kits"
        class="px-5 py-3.5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 font-semibold rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 transition text-xs sm:text-sm"
      >
        Generador de Decretos
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Clean Metrics Pills -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 text-center shadow-xs">
        <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 dark:text-white mb-0.5">1 Dic 2026</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Entrada en Vigencia Plena</div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 text-center shadow-xs">
        <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-0.5">30 Días</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Plazo Derechos Ciudadanos</div>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 text-center shadow-xs">
        <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-0.5">100% Local</div>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Privacidad y Zero-Storage</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 Main Action Modules (Big Clean Cards) -->
  <section class="py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto border-t border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 block mb-1">
        Herramientas GovTech
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">
        ¿Qué deseas hacer hoy?
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
      <!-- Card 1: Diagnóstico -->
      <a href="/diagnostico" class="clean-card bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-400 dark:hover:border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between group cursor-pointer shadow-xs">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/80 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition">
            📊
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white mb-1">
            Autodiagnóstico Municipal (IMM)
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Evalúa tu municipio en 7 dimensiones, obtén tu nivel de madurez e imprime una hoja de ruta para el Concejo.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>Comenzar evaluación</span>
          <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 2: Filtro SaaS -->
      <a href="/filtro" class="clean-card bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-400 dark:hover:border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between group cursor-pointer shadow-xs">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/80 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition">
            ⚡
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white mb-1">
            Filtro Preventivo SaaS (EIPD)
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Pasa nuevos trámites, licitaciones o cámaras por el simulador de privacidad antes de ponerlos en marcha.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>Evaluar trámite o proyecto</span>
          <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 3: Generador de Decretos -->
      <a href="/kits" class="clean-card bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-400 dark:hover:border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between group cursor-pointer shadow-xs">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition">
            📑
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white mb-1">
            Generador de Decretos y DPAs
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Personaliza decretos de DPO, cláusulas para proveedores en Mercado Público y convenios de confidencialidad RSH.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>Generar instrumentos</span>
          <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 4: Matriz RAT -->
      <a href="/rat" class="clean-card bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-400 dark:hover:border-slate-700 p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between group cursor-pointer shadow-xs">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-105 transition">
            🗂️
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white mb-1">
            Matriz de Tratamientos (RAT)
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Mapea las bases de datos de Salud, Social y Tránsito y descárgalas en Excel (CSV) o JSON estructurado.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>Explorar matriz comunal</span>
          <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Clean Bottom Consultation Callout -->
  <section class="py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xs flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white mb-1">
          ¿Necesitas apoyo en la implementación municipal?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          Acompañamiento técnico disponible mediante los mecanismos de contratación pública que resulten procedentes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="mailto:evega.ap@gmail.com?subject=Consulta%20ProtegeDatosLocal%20Municipal"
        class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-slate-950 dark:bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-600 dark:hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl transition shrink-0"
      >
        Contactar a Eduardo Vega Toledo →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
